@ ---- LBL :RECORD: the record of Z = R30, "name/mass/state/boiling point/configuration", in R44;
@ R37 name, R35 mass (LBL :FIELD: takes the fields in order; R44 keeps the rest).
@ One record per label: LBL Z in ELD1 (Z 1-60), LBL Z - 60 in ELD2 (Z 61-118); R43 the label,
@ XEQ IND 43 there ----
LBL 05
RCL 30
STO 43
60
X<Y?
